    "sentence_translations": [
      "(8) Too Few",
      "",
      "I was under a book listening to Apple and Chacha talk, but they didn’t know.",
      "",
      "Apple said, “It’s really fun! My owner really does listen to me. I know what she likes. I know what she likes to buy.",
      "If I open Taobao for 20 minutes, she looks at Taobao for 20 minutes.",
      "If I open TikTok for 50 minutes, she watches TikTok for 50 minutes.”",
      "",
      "“Excellent!” Chacha was very happy. He asked Apple, “How about Xiaomi? How is he? Does Daxing listen to him?”",
      "",
      "“Daxing does listen to him. Daxing likes playing Pokemon,” Apple said.",
      "",
      "“Fantastic!” Chacha thought and said, “But just the three of us cell phones is too few.”",
      "",
      "Apple didn’t know what Chacha meant. He asked, “Too few? What do you mean?”",
      "",
      "Chacha said, “Yes, it’s too few. We need new friends.”"
    ]
